<title>JORDAN: Jordan dinar overnight rate falls to 8.36 pct.</title>
<headline>Jordan dinar overnight rate falls to 8.36 pct.</headline>
<dateline>AMMAN 1997-01-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The weighted average overnight interbank rate on the Jordanian dinar fell to 8.36 percent on Saturday from 9.02 percent on Thursday, the Central Bank said.</p>
<p>It said seven banks traded on the market in 15 reported transactions with a total value of 21.5 million dinars ($30.36 million).</p>
<p>$1 = 0.7080 dinar</p>
<p>-- Amman newsroom +962 6 623 776  REUTER de</p>
